flowchart TD
  Upload[Validated upload] --> Obj[S3 original]
  Upload --> Job[PostgreSQL document + outbox]
  Job --> Claim[Worker claim + lease]
  Claim --> Download[Download to temporary directory]
  Download --> Convert[PDF or image-to-one-page-PDF]
  Convert --> Text[PyMuPDF text and table extraction]
  Text --> OCR{Low text and OCR available?}
  OCR -->|Yes| Tesseract[Local Tesseract]
  OCR -->|No| Rule[Classification + entity/section rules]
  Tesseract --> Rule
  Rule --> Results[Persist pages, tables, entities, provenance, stages]
  Results --> Decision{Review reasons?}
  Decision -->|Yes| Review[review_required]
  Decision -->|No| Complete[completed]
  Results --> Index[Independent chunk/index job]
  Index --> PGChunks[Persist PostgreSQL chunks]
  Index --> Vector[Optional embeddings + Qdrant]
